  "applies_to": "KMC AppStat (BAC-4000 series) room controllers configured for the two-pipe fan coil application.",
  "summary": "The AppStat is a wall-mounted BACnet MS/TP room controller (thermostat style) with fixed applications for fan coils, rooftop units and heat pumps. Its objects cover inputs (room, remote, discharge and outdoor or water temperature, humidity, motion), the outputs for the chosen application, setpoints, operating modes, a schedule and PID loops.",
