  "access_inferred": true,
  "notes": [
    "Outputs are from Table 7-2 of the guide; inputs, values, schedule and loops are shared by all AppStat applications. Not every object is present in every model.",
    "The guide has no read/write column; access is inferred (setpoints and modes writable, measured and calculated values read-only, outputs commandable).",
    "AI2 is WATER_TEMP on fan coil models and OAT on heat pump and rooftop models.",
    "No units or multi-state texts are printed in the object tables.",
    "The table also prints BO1 as FAN_START_STOP (Fan Start/Stop), presumably for the variable-speed fan option; BO1 LOW is listed here."
  ],
