    "enable": "Occupancy state is held in BV5 OCC_SCHEDULE, the reference of the controller's own schedule SCHED_1 (holiday schedules are its exception schedule).",
    "heartbeat": null,
    "remote_sensors": "A remote room sensor can be wired to AI1 REMOTE_SENSOR; the guide does not describe writing room temperature over BACnet.",
    "setup": [
      "Set device instance, MAC address and baud on the AppStat (Set up communications section) before connecting.",
